            "review_title": "Review at Hanabi Japanese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Passarinha-88\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nAmazing and beautiful seasonal tempura!!\nMar 2019\nThis place will never let you down! Changes menu each month which includes Japanese seasonal foods and atmosphere. You will never be tired of going there to try new menu. Quality of tempura and other Japanese food here is simply amazing! And personally chef's post on fb and instagram is hilarious (only in Japanese). You need to book in advance.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 8, 2019",
