            "review_title": "Review at Hanabi Japanese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "yaps66\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam52 contributions\n0\nI dream of tempura!\nJul 2018 • Family\nCan you imagine being served one tempura at a time? This is what you get here and every single morsel is lovingly presented and delicious. The location of the restaurant and the decor is modest but the food is good. It is different and not your standard Japanese fare and dare I say nouvelle in nature. Chef Taka used to be the chef for the Japanese consulate in Ho Chi Minh City and is to be commended for his efforts and bringing good Japanese cuisine and service to a city that is already teeming with standard fare Japanese food! Kudos!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 13, 2018",
